      "fondo": "bifrost",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 300,
        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.08
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Para unir tantos mundos, los dioses construyeron un puente de colores: Bifrost, el arcoíris.",
          "en": "To join so many worlds, the gods built a bridge of colors: Bifrost, the rainbow."
        },
        {
          "es": "Conecta Midgard con Asgard, y una de sus franjas arde en llamas rojas para que los gigantes no puedan cruzarlo.",
          "en": "It links Midgard to Asgard, and one of its bands burns with red flame so that the giants cannot cross it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ese rojo es fuego de verdad. Por eso el arcoíris tiene una franja roja.",
          "en": "That red is real fire. That is why the rainbow has a red band."
        },
        {
          "es": "En el extremo del puente vive Heimdall, el guardián de los dioses.",
          "en": "At the end of the bridge lives Heimdall, the guardian of the gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Heimdall duerme menos que un pájaro, ve a cien leguas de día y de noche, y oye crecer la hierba.",
          "en": "Heimdall sleeps less than a bird, sees a hundred leagues by day and by night, and can hear the grass grow."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tiene un cuerno que hará sonar cuando llegue el fin del mundo.",
          "en": "He has a horn that he will sound when the end of the world comes."
        }
      ],
